# Zxk <lineag896@gmail.com>
# Clover WCN3990 ICNSS 
#
# clover-only icnss work:
# - describes the two WLAN 3.3 V rails and stable device MAC;
# - adds the ICNSS compatibility ABI and explicit module wiring;
# - implements WLFW/athdiag, MSA, board-data, calibration, recovery, and
#   firmware-ready sequencing used by the QCACLD client;
# - keeps the WLAN transport explicit-load only so other SDM660 devices do
#   not bind this client automatically.
#
# functions:
# - icnss_clover_probe/remove: create and tear down the Clover platform client.
# - icnss_server_work: sequence QMI service registration and firmware readiness.
# - ICNSS board/calibration helpers: transfer BDF data and report calibration.
# - recovery/PM helpers: preserve ownership and power across restart/suspend.
