+	select QCOM_QMI_HELPERS
+	help
+	  Bind Clover's WCN3990 platform device, bring up the WLFW QMI
+	  service and MSA permissions, expose the twelve copy-engine IRQs,
+	  and provide the legacy ICNSS client ABI used by Xiaomi qcacld-3.0.
+
+	  Build this as a module so ath10k_snoc remains an unloadable
+	  fallback during bring-up.
